---
// Desktop hero: real Hyderabad traffic with real detector output drawn over it.
// The video only loads on wide screens; phones get HeroDashcam instead.
---
<figure class="figure hero-scene" data-scene data-reveal>
  <div class="scene-frame">
    <picture>
      <source srcset="/media/hyderabad-traffic.webp" type="image/webp" />
      <img class="scene-poster" src="/media/hyderabad-traffic.jpg" alt="Traffic under a flyover in Hyderabad: cars, motorcycles, an auto-rickshaw and a traffic officer." width="1280" height="720" loading="eager" decoding="async" />
    </picture>
    <canvas class="scene-overlay" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
    <p class="scene-hud scene-hud-tl">cam_front · Hyderabad · 24 Hz</p>
    <p class="scene-hud scene-hud-tr" data-counts aria-live="off"></p>
    <div class="scene-tip" data-tip hidden></div>
    <div class="scene-controls" role="group" aria-label="Scene controls">
      <button type="button" data-act="play" aria-pressed="true">Pause</button>
      <button type="button" data-act="boxes" aria-pressed="true">Boxes</button>
      <button type="button" data-act="trails" aria-pressed="true">Trails</button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <b>Fig. 0</b> Real traffic under a flyover in Hyderabad. Every box and track ID is real output from YOLO11 with ByteTrack, run offline. Hover a road user to see what the detector sees. It has no class for auto-rickshaws, so it calls them trucks. Indian roads are full of cases like that.
    Video: <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Traffic_in_Hyderabad.webm" target="_blank" rel="noopener">“Traffic in Hyderabad”</a> by Oleg Yunakov, <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, trimmed.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .scene-frame { position: relative; aspect-ratio: 16 / 7.2; background: var(--asphalt); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .scene-frame :global(img), .scene-frame :global(video) { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; }
  .scene-frame :global(video) { opacity: 0; transition: opacity .6s; }
  .scene-frame :global(video.ready) { opacity: 1; }
  .scene-overlay { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; cursor: crosshair; }
  .scene-hud { position: absolute; margin: 0; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: 1; color: #f5f5f1; background: rgba(16, 18, 20, .62); padding: 6px 8px; pointer-events: none; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .scene-hud-tl { top: 12px; left: 12px; }
  .scene-hud-tr { top: 12px; right: 12px; }
  .scene-hud-tr:empty { display: none; }
  .scene-controls { position: absolute; left: 12px; bottom: 12px; display: flex; gap: 6px; }
  .scene-controls button { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: 1; padding: 7px 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 245, 241, .5); background: rgba(16, 18, 20, .62); color: #f5f5f1; cursor: pointer; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); }
  .scene-controls button[aria-pressed="false"] { opacity: .6; }
  .scene-controls button:hover { border-color: #f5f5f1; }
  .scene-tip { position: absolute; min-width: 15em; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: var(--fs-xs); line-height: 1.5; color: #14161a; background: #f0b429; padding: 8px 10px; pointer-events: none; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(20, 22, 26, .2); }
  .scene-tip :global(b) { display: block; font-size: var(--fs-sm); }
  .scene-tip :global(em) { display: block; font-style: normal; margin-top: 4px; max-width: 26ch; }
</style>

<script>
  import '../scripts/scene';
</script>
